      <p class="sub">The math from the featured guide, live. Enter one SKU’s numbers and see its days of cover, its reorder point, and how many to order — using your own sales, not a rule of thumb.</p>
      <div class="calc-row">
        <div><label>Average daily sales (units)</label><input type="number" id="dailySales" value="0.8" min="0" step="0.1"></div>
        <div><label>Stock on hand (units)</label><input type="number" id="onHand" value="14" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Supplier lead time (days)</label><input type="number" id="leadTime" value="4" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Safety buffer (days)</label><input type="number" id="safetyDays" value="5" min="0" step="1"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="calc-result">
        <div><span>Days of cover</span><b id="coverOut">18</b></div>
        <div><span>Reorder point</span><b id="pointOut">7 units</b></div>
        <div><span>Order now qty</span><b id="qtyOut">0</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="calc-status" id="calcStatus" role="status"></div>
      <p class="calc-note">Reorder point = average daily sales × (lead time + safety days). Suggested order quantity tops you back up to the reorder point — round up to case packs where your supplier requires it. Worked example: the featured guide runs these same numbers across a full shelf.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Start Here: Pick Your Path</h3>
      <p class="sub">New to the guides? Each path is a short sequence — do them in order and each one makes the next easier.</p>
      <ul class="topics">
        <li><span class="num">1</span><div><button onclick="openGuide('stockcount')"><b>Stockroom in a day</b><small>Full count → reorder points → par levels &amp; labels (Guides 1 + 2)</small></button></div></li>
        <li><span class="num">2</span><div><button onclick="openGuide('fleetaudit')"><b>Know the fleet</b><small>Fleet audit in one visit → meter reads &amp; cost-per-page reports (Guides 3 + 7)</small></button></div></li>
        <li><span class="num">3</span><div><button onclick="openGuide('tonerswap')"><b>Counter confidence</b><small>Clean toner swap → drum replacement &amp; reset (Guides 4 + 5)</small></button></div></li>
        <li><span class="num">4</span><div><button onclick="openGuide('diagnose')"><b>First-call fixes</b><small>Read a test page → clear jams without damage (Guides 6 + 8)</small></button></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
